  "description": "Fuaran.Compute.Conformance — the law families over the dataframe layer, beside the Fuaran.Core.Conformance kit they extend: transform parity against the DataFrame reference evaluator, the columnar op-algebra and op-stream (ColumnOps), incremental evaluation (evalFrom and the IncrementalDelta equivalence family), params and slot params, the static output-schema walk, the pinned evaluation clock, and aggregate-versus-GroupBy parity. The families ship in module DataFrameConformance; the pre-split Conformance.* spellings forward to them (marked for removal in Phase 258). FSharp.Core only, Fable-clean.",
